    ⚠️ settings❗️                           💭 problems; empty when usable

  Nothing that is wrong with a setting raises or stops anything here. It is
  recorded, and the server refuses to start while there is a record.
📗
🐇 🎚 🍇
  🖍🆕 keys 🗝
  💭 By the key's place in 🗝: whether the setting is text, its number and the range the
  💭 number must stay in, its text, and the texts it may be (joined with ", "; empty: any).
  💭 A text setting may be a list of some of those texts, with commas between. Its
  💭 number then says which: a bit for each, the first one's the lowest, so that what
  💭 reads the setting for every request has no text to take apart.
